          "num": 1,
          "title": "Nama Rule Deskriptif",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 \u2705 \"Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri\"\n\u2022 \u274c \"Rule Baru 1\"\n\u2022 Sertakan jenis fraud, threshold, atau wilayah",
          "color": "#3b82f6",
          "bg": "#eff6ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;\"><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #86efac;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#16a34a;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16a34a\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M6 12l4 4 8-8\"/></svg> Deteksi Transfer Besar ke Luar Negeri</div><div style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:5px;background:#fef2f2;border:1px solid #fecaca;font-size:7px;font-weight:600;color:#dc2626;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#dc2626\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M18 6L6 18M6 6l12 12\"/></svg> Rule Baru 1</div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Multi-node untuk Logika Kompleks",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Jangan gabung semua logika dalam satu node\n\u2022 Pisahkan jadi beberapa node spesifik\n\u2022 Contoh: CONSTANT (amount) \u2192 AND \u2192 ALERT",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #ddd6fe;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;gap:4px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#f59e0b;\">AMOUNT</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #6366f1;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#6366f1;\">AND</span><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#94a3b8\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7\"/></svg><span style=\"padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid #ef4444;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#ef4444;\">ALERT</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Auto-Arrange Rutin",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Klik **Auto-Arrange** kalau flow berantakan\n\u2022 Susun ulang node dari kiri ke kanan\n\u2022 Gunakan Connected Move agar node tetangga ikut bergerak",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fff);border:1px solid #fde68a;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;justify-content:center;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">\u2728 Auto-Arrange</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#92400e;\">Satu klik, layout langsung rapi</span></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Gunakan Groups",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Kelompokkan node terkait dengan **Group**\n\u2022 Beri nama deskriptif (\"Cek Amount\", \"Cek Velocity\")\n\u2022 Group bisa di-collapse, di-copy antar rule",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:#fff;border:1px solid #fbcfe8;overflow:hidden;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"border:1.5px dashed #ec4899;border-radius:6px;padding:8px;\"><div style=\"font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#db2777;margin-bottom:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:4px;\"><svg width=\"10\" height=\"10\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#db2777\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"><path d=\"M22 19a2 2 0 01-2 2H4a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 012 2z\"/></svg> Cek Amount</div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:4px;\"><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#f59e0b;\">CONSTANT</span><span style=\"padding:2px 6px;border-radius:3px;background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;font-size:6px;font-weight:600;color:#10b981;\">CONTAINS</span></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Test Sebelum Aktivasi",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n\u2022 Gunakan **Run Verification** untuk simulasi\n\u2022 Cek false positive dan false negative\n\u2022 Minta review tim sebelum aktivasi",
          "color": "#14b8a6",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style=\"font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.04),0 1px 6px rgba(0,0,0,.06);background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdfa,#fff);border:1px solid #99f6e4;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\"><span style=\"padding:5px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#14b8a6;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;\">\u25b6\ufe0f Run Verification</span><span style=\"font-size:7px;color:#475569;\">Simulasi rule sebelum aktivasi</span></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
